 TWILIGHT_OF_THE_INTERWAR_ERA_NAME:0 "Twilight of the Interwar Era"
 TWILIGHT_OF_THE_INTERWAR_ERA:0 "A time of upheval and great change has arrived upon the World. In the East, the fires of the Bolshevik and Xinhai Revolutions reverberate, promising conflict from the Black Sea to the shores of the Pacific. In the West, the forces of National Socialism have taken root in the heart of Germany, and seek to reunify a disunited heartland. The opposing forces of the French and British Empires promise a great conflict, while revanchist forces make their moves in the Balkans and the Middle East. The Sleeping Giant of the USA is awakening in the face of an ascendant Socialist movement, and the Italian state continues to amend secular bureocracy and clerical papacy. The dynamics of the Interwar Era are being shattered, as new movements rise to carve a new destiny in the twilight of a setting sun."
